      "   0.3: F1=0.8424±0.0342 (n=16.0)\n",
      "   0.35: F1=0.8424±0.0342 (n=16.0)\n",
      "\n",
      "📊 Chi2_K Impact:\n",
      "   3: F1=0.8531±0.0318 (n=20.0)\n",
